&lt;h2 id=&#34;which-should-you-choose&#34;&gt;Which Should You Choose?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;choose-netdevh-when-immediate-stability-matters&#34;&gt;Choose net.devh When Immediate Stability Matters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong compatibility with existing and large-scale projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive documentation and examples&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;choose-spring-grpc-for-modern-spring-projects&#34;&gt;Choose Spring gRPC for Modern Spring Projects&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
